        rules: {
          objective: 'Take more tricks than the opponents. Teams score token cards; first team to collect 10 or more tokens wins.',
          gameplay: "1. After trump is announced, player to dealer's right leads any card. 2. Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Players must follow suit if able; otherwise may play any card. 3. Highest trump wins; if no trump played, highest card of suit led wins. 4. Trick winner gathers cards, leads next trick. 5. After 8 tricks, tokens are awarded according to the scoring table.",
          keyRules: [
            "Trump chosen by player to dealer's right after seeing only first 4 cards.",
            'Must follow suit if able.',
            '8 tricks total.',
            'Token scoring: 4-4 split = no tokens, but extra token next time a team takes more than 4.',
            '5-7 tricks for trump-choosing team = 1 token; for non-declarers = 2 tokens.',
            'All 8 tricks (Kapothi/Basthe) = 3 tokens.',
            'First team to 10 tokens wins.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'When choosing trumps, select the suit in which you have most cards. Between two equal suits, prefer the one without the aceâ€”the ace is likely to win a trick whether trump or not.',
          intermediate: "Remember what cards have been played. Do not normally beat or trump your partner's winning card. Use discards to signal: if partner leads and you have no cards of that suit, discard from a suit you want led (e.g. your highest or only card of that suit).",
          advanced: 'Finesse: holding ace and queen of a led suit, play the queen to gain a trick when the opponent to your left has the king. With four cards in four different suits, picking trump is a guess; some players choose the suit of the lowest card.',
          tips: [
            'Partnership cooperation is essential.',
            'When holding four cards in three suits with two low in one suit, some choose the suit you have none of, hoping partner gets trumps.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
